{"product_id":"kismet","title":"Kismet","description":"\u003cp\u003eWith a big birthday just around the corner, an important new project at work, and a boyfriend she suspects might be about to ask her a significant question, Anna should feel like she has it all together. But somehow, she just doesn't seem to be sure about, well, anything. So she gets out her phone and decides to download Kismet. Will she embrace the life she has, or risk everything for the life she imagines?--Provided by publisher. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:28 x 216  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Luke Tredget \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780571334872 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: hardcover \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 400\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44615606304921,"sku":"4RA9780571334872","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/55adebca422123e3cae4217d5913d103.jpg?v=1721322068","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/kismet","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}